      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would disagree with this. Whenever you change a java file, [errorprone runs in presubmit](http://google3/configs/wireless/android/busytown/platform/git_master/git_master.gcl;l\u003d2071;rcl\u003d444891856) for all java code across the whole source tree. So it\u0027s essentially enabled by default. I think when we migrate to bazel, we should just have errorprone on by default even for local builds to be consistent.",
